commit 098469b64b2c3c6605de9cc620a73da2b4e1e3c9

C03: «tengo el brillo al máximo» reads the brightness instead of agreeing (BRIGHT1319)

effect_intent.brightness_status_request: a claim or question about the present level at an extreme («tengo el brillo al máximo», «¿está el brillo al mínimo?», «tengo el brillo alto») is the same system.settings.status read; the answer reports the observed value. Numeric claims stay with the existing digit guard; past or hypothetical states stay out.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


